<title>HUNGARY: Expanded CESI index ends a shade higher.</title>
<headline>Expanded CESI index ends a shade higher.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>The CESI Central European Share Index advanced on Thursday to close at 1,396.96 points, up 3.76 points or 0.27 percent, the Budapest Stock Stock Exchange said.</p>
<p>The index basket was modified effective today to include Slovenian and Slovak stocks in addition to Hungarian, Czech and Polish papers.</p>
<p>The index, which has been published since February 1, reflect trends of 73 shares on the Budapest, Prague, Warsaw, Bratislava and Ljubljana bourses.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom (36 1) 327-4040</p>
